      "answerKeyRef": null,
      "explanation": "The sphere has radius 21/2 = 10.5 cm. Assuming no material loss and using the conventional π = 22/7, its volume is (4/3) × (22/7) × (10.5)³ = 4851 cm³. Each cube has volume 1 cm³, so 4851 cubes are formed. Verified solution (unofficial); original printed paper and worked derivation checked on 26 October 2026.",
